        {
          "insert": " dependency). There is no explicit Reload button in the current UI: refreshing the page or navigating between scenes triggers a fresh load. When the editor has unsaved edits, the command hook guards reload, close, and link navigation before those edits are discarded. The dirty flag is reset by "
        },
        {
          "insert": "markClean()",
